  "reviews": [
    {
      "body": "## Code Review\n\nThis pull request addresses two issues: it improves a misleading error message for cancellation requests on completed responses and reduces log noise by changing an error-level log for intentional cancellations to a debug-level log. The changes are correct and beneficial. I've added one comment to further improve the robustness of the cancellation logic by handling cases where the background task might fail with an exception other than `CancelledError` during the cancellation process, which would prevent the `cancel` endpoint from returning a 500 error.",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/35662#pullrequestreview-3872538676",
      "id": 3872538676,
